source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-22
observed: This instance cannot resolve target `b` and shows an error span with the text intact; jiro warns on the piped-link shape because whether a piped link renders depends on the Jira Instance, where an issue key, user, anchor or attachment target resolves, and not on the markup.
-- input.jira --
{{[a|b]}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt><span class="error">&#91;a|b&#93;</span></tt></p>
-- want.md --
`[a|b]`
-- warnings.json --
[
 {
  "Line": 1,
  "Column": 1,
  "Construct": "inline-code",
  "Reason": "Jira would render a link inside this Monospace Span; inline code keeps the characters literal"
 }
]
